{"thread":{"threadID":4406,"boardID":117,"topic":"Team News - 11.04.2017","time":1491940923,"userID":2199,"username":"OxygeN","lastPostTime":1492004167,"lastPoster":"Guenter_VI","replies":35,"views":1807,"attachments":0,"isSticky":0,"isClosed":0,"cumulativeLikes":10},"tags":[],"posts":[{"postID":64531,"threadID":4406,"userID":2199,"username":"OxygeN","subject":"Team News - 11.04.2017","time":1491940923,"lastEditTime":1491942247,"editCount":1,"editReason":"","attachments":[],"cumulativeLikes":10,"editorID":2199,"editor":"OxygeN","likes":[{"userID":2365,"username":"MistaHT","time":1491941012,"value":1},{"userID":2326,"username":"Unicorn24","time":1491941130,"value":1},{"userID":2369,"username":"Luckiris","time":1491941183,"value":1},{"userID":1563,"username":"aPex.","time":1491942460,"value":1},{"userID":2335,"username":"Thorin Pikachu","time":1491942878,"value":1},{"userID":2368,"username":"Zelimirus","time":1491946439,"value":1},{"userID":2039,"username":"Wario","time":1491947795,"value":1},{"userID":1791,"username":"Pixel","time":1491948431,"value":1},{"userID":2229,"username":"WHAT","time":1491948691,"value":1},{"userID":2052,"username":"YellowWonderchild","time":1491950854,"value":1}],"bodyHtml":"<p>Hello Dear Dream Community.</p>\n<p><br></p>\n<p>Today I have made a decision of leaving the team due to not being active anymore and spending more time with friend&#x27;s and due to my &quot;admin abuse&quot; I will not leave the community totally I will still play from time to time but this is for sure not total community leave.</p>\n<p><br></p>\n<p><a href=\"http://dream-community.de/index.php?user/1563-apex/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noopener noreferrer\">@aPex.</a> Thank you for making my days here great with your soundboard and memes you were a great guy and I hope you will achieve everything you want.<br><a href=\"http://dream-community.de/index.php?user/2229-what/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noopener noreferrer\">@WHAT</a> Thank you for your support and constant commitment to helping me achieve more, you&#x27;re a great guy and I hope you achieve a lot here.<br><a href=\"http://dream-community.de/index.php?user/2369-luckiris/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noopener noreferrer\">@Luckiris</a> Thank&#x27;s for your constant support and helping me improve you are a nice guy and my favorite guy from France.<br><a href=\"http://dream-community.de/index.php?user/2326-unicorn24/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noopener noreferrer\">@Unicorn24</a> We had a lot of fun together playing different gamemodes either ( TTT, MG or knife one day )<br><a href=\"http://dream-community.de/index.php?user/2368-zelimir/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noopener noreferrer\">@Zelimir</a> Hope you achieve a lot you are a great guy.<br><a href=\"http://dream-community.de/index.php?user/2335-thorin-pikachu/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noopener noreferrer\">@Thorin Pikachu</a> You are a nice guy and someone with a lot of time to spare off helping other hope you achieve a lot in this community.<br><a href=\"http://dream-community.de/index.php?user/1599-abendstille/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noopener noreferrer\">@Abendstille</a> Thank you for supporting me with stuff I did not knew in German you are a nice guy and I hope you will earn what you deserve here.<br><a href=\"http://dream-community.de/index.php?user/2043-apudox/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noopener noreferrer\">@ApudoX</a> We talked from time to time and I enjoyed playing with you, stay true.<br><a href=\"http://dream-community.de/index.php?user/1791-pixel/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noopener noreferrer\">@Pixel</a> Thanks for making my signature for dream I like it and I enjoyed playing with you from time to time.<br><a href=\"http://dream-community.de/index.php?user/1812-mike/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noopener noreferrer\">@Mike</a> I enjoyed playing battlefield with you and server gamemodes, you&#x27;re a nice guy and I hope you achieve a lot.<br><a href=\"http://dream-community.de/index.php?user/2404-mas0n/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noopener noreferrer\">@Mas0n</a> Hope you achieve what you want here and remember the help I gave you.<br><a href=\"http://dream-community.de/index.php?user/2365-mistaht/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noopener noreferrer\">@MistaHT</a> We can still sell lemonade together, hope you have a great time.<br><a href=\"http://dream-community.de/index.php?user/1954-wickedy/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noopener noreferrer\">@wickedy</a> It was great playing TTT with you and I had fun with you, hope you achieve a lot more.<br><a href=\"http://dream-community.de/index.php?user/1153-schockly/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noopener noreferrer\">@Schockly</a> I hope you have a great time and you enjoy everything here.<br><a href=\"http://dream-community.de/index.php?user/2223-nekocedx3/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noopener noreferrer\">@NekoCedx3</a> You&#x27;re a great guy and very funny, I enjoyed playing with you and hope you will have a great day and we will play again ♥</p>","polls":[]},{"postID":64532,"threadID":4406,"userID":2365,"username":"MistaHT","subject":"","time":1491941059,"lastEditTime":0,"editCount":0,"editReason":null,"attachments":[],"cumulativeLikes":3,"editorID":null,"editor":"","likes":[{"userID":2369,"username":"Luckiris","time":1491941173,"value":1},{"userID":2199,"username":"OxygeN","time":1491941311,"value":1},{"userID":2326,"username":"Unicorn24","time":1491941350,"value":1}],"bodyHtml":"<p>R.I.P Oxygen, miss you.</p>\n<p><br></p>\n<p>PS: We will earn much money <span class=\"missing-media\">[;)]</span></p>","polls":[]},{"postID":64533,"threadID":4406,"userID":2326,"username":"Unicorn24","subject":"","time":1491941270,"lastEditTime":0,"editCount":0,"editReason":null,"attachments":[],"cumulativeLikes":2,"editorID":null,"editor":"","likes":[{"userID":2369,"username":"Luckiris","time":1491941300,"value":1},{"u