}],"bodyHtml":"<p>Hello,</p>\n<p><br></p>\n<p>please note, that Oxygen has not decided to leave the team by himself but rather by being kicked out of it.<br>Not wanting to stay is surely a reason for his behaviour, but regardless of that, it was not a voluntarily decision.</p>\n<p><br></p>\n<p>He was kicked because of his activity, but even more important, massive disrespect towards other admins and leaders (including kicks of admins on TeamSpeak).<br>We don&#x27;t want people in the team who are too stubborn to recognize their own mistakes and don&#x27;t have control over their emotions.</p>\n<p><br></p>\n<p>Regardless of that, we still thank you for your help as an Admin.</p>","polls":[]},{"postID":64542,"threadID":4406,"userID":2199,"username":"OxygeN","subject":"","time":1491943844,"lastEditTime":0,"editCount":0,"editReason":null,"attachments":[],"cumulativeLikes":2,"editorID":null,"editor":"","likes":[{"userID":2369,"username":"Luckiris","time":1491943952,"value":1},{"userID":2404,"username":"Mas0n","time":1491944697,"value":1}],"bodyHtml":"<p><a href=\"http://dream-community.de/index.php?user/1825-nachtfrische/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noopener noreferrer\">@Nachtfrische</a> me and mason explained this to each other, It&#x27;s you that kinda made a too fast decision as I WANTED to stay.</p>","polls":[]},{"postID":64543,"threadID":4406,"userID":2378,"username":"Verdia","subject":"","time":1491943870,"lastEditTime":0,"editCount":0,"editReason":null,"attachments":[],"cumulativeLikes":4,"editorID":null,"editor":"","likes":[{"userID":2369,"username":"Luckiris","time":1491943954,"value":1},{"userID":1825,"username":"Nachtfrische","time":1491943968,"value":1},{"userID":2404,"username":"Mas0n","time":1491944361,"value":1},{"userID":2526,"username":"Burn","time":1491959853,"value":1}],"bodyHtml":"<p>Exposed<s></s></p>","polls":[]},{"postID":64544,"threadID":4406,"userID":2375,"username":"<<<","subject":"","time":1491943898,"lastEditTime":0,"editCount":0,"editReason":null,"attachments":[],"cumulativeLikes":1,"editorID":null,"editor":"","likes":[{"userID":2369,"username":"Luckiris","time":1491943955,"value":1}],"bodyHtml":"<p><span class=\"missing-media\">[Bild]</span>  R.I.P sadface</p>","polls":[]},{"postID":64546,"threadID":4406,"userID":1825,"username":"Nachtfrische","subject":"","time":1491944693,"lastEditTime":0,"editCount":0,"editReason":null,"attachments":[],"cumulativeLikes":2,"editorID":null,"editor":"","likes":[{"userID":2404,"username":"Mas0n","time":1491944752,"value":1},{"userID":2326,"username":"Unicorn24","time":1491981937,"value":1}],"bodyHtml":"<blockquote class=\"archive-quote\"><cite>Zitat von <strong>OxygeN</strong></cite><p>It&#x27;s you that kinda made a too fast decision as I WANTED to stay.<br></p></blockquote><p>You wrote in your own post, that you wanted to leave?<br>Regardless of what you wanted, we can not keep you in the team if you are rude and show disrespect towards members of the team.</p>\n<p><br></p>\n<p>The decision has been made and will not be reverted.</p>","polls":[]},{"postID":64547,"threadID":4406,"userID":2199,"username":"OxygeN","subject":"","time":1491944744,"lastEditTime":0,"editCount":0,"editReason":"","attachments":[],"cumulativeLikes":2,"editorID":null,"editor":"","likes":[{"userID":2369,"username":"Luckiris","time":1491944927,"value":1},{"userID":2326,"username":"Unicorn24","time":1491981958,"value":1}],"bodyHtml":"<blockquote class=\"archive-quote\"><cite>Zitat von <strong>Nachtfrische</strong></cite><p>You wrote in your own post, that you wanted to leave?Regardless of what you wanted, we can not keep you in the team if you are rude and show disrespect towards members of the team.</p>\n<p><br></p>\n<p>The decision has been made and will not be reverted.<br></p></blockquote><p>Me and mason spoke to each other and got this clear  but YOUR DECISION WAS TAKEN TOO FAST</p>\n<p><br></p>\n<p><br></p>\n<p>//EDIT: YOU DID NOT GAVE ME A CHOICE</p>","polls":[]},{"postID":64549,"threadID":4406,"userID":1825,"username":"Nachtfrische","subject":"","time":1491945138,"lastEditTime":0,"editCount":0,"editReason":null,"attachments":[],"cumulativeLikes":1,"editorID":null,"editor":"","likes":[{"userID":2404,"username":"Mas0n","time":1491945507,"value":1}],"bodyHtml":"<blockquote class=\"archive-quote\"><cite>Zitat von <strong>OxygeN</strong></cite><p>//EDIT: YOU DID NOT GAVE ME A CHOICE\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<br></p></blockquote><p>I thought you&#x27;ve mentioned, that you wanted to leave by yourself?<br>Anyways, like I&#x27;ve already said, it&#x27;s not about choice. If you are being rude and disrespectful towards other staff members (+ admin abuse), it&#x27;s not up to you to decide, if you want to stay or not.</p>\n<p><br></p>\n<p>The kick was 100% legitimate, there is no need to start any uproar.</p>","polls":[]},{"postID":64550,"threadID":4406,"userID":2335,"username":"Thorin Pikachu","subject":"","time":1491945230,"lastEditTime":0,"editCount":0,"editReason":"","attachments":[],"cumulativeLikes":4,"editorID":null,"editor":"","likes":[{"userID":2369,"username":"Luckiris","time":1491945251,"value":1},{"userID":2199,"username":"OxygeN","time":1491945258,"value":1},{"userID":2052,"username":"YellowWonderchild","time":1491950975,"value":1},{"userID":2326,"username":"Unicorn24","time":1491982004,"value":1}],"bodyHtml":"<p>Ok here is the deal. He did wrong thing but you should consider a warning. Take Raven for example. He wasn&#x27;t breaking rules but he was inactive for a long time and he was kicked after such a long time and when Oxy does this you kick him instantly. Where is the logic? I am not trying to be offensive, but this was hurried. You are a co-leader so I respect your descision (kinda) but this wasn&#x27;t good in my opinion.<br><a href=\"http://dream-community.de/index.php?user/1825-nachtfrische/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noopener noreferrer\">@Nachtfrische</a></p>","polls":[]},{"postID":64551,"threadID":4406,"userID":2199,"username":